      "Do not rasterize ordinary text.",
      "Do not invent Roblox asset ids.",
      "Do not combine UIListLayout/UIGridLayout with conflicting manual child positioning.",
      "Do not treat Kekui as a runtime dependency in Luau gameplay code."
